                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>· Champions</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> — Protect high-value repeat behavior and retention</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>· High-value at Risk</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> — Prioritize reactivation; 11.2% of customers contribute 19.5% of revenue</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>· New / Promising</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> — Focus on converting first purchase into repeat behavior</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>· Dormant</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> — Large customer base but relatively limited revenue contribution</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b4b4b4' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Actions are analytical hypotheses based on observed behavior, not experimentally validated recommendations.</run>
